                        Revert all customized UI text, headers, and button labels back to default phrasing.
                    </p>
                    <button id="resetAllTextBtnModal" class="w-full bg-amber-200 dark:bg-amber-900/60 hover:bg-amber-300 text-amber-950 dark:text-amber-100 font-bold py-2 rounded-xl text-xs transition flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left"></i>
